.git
.github
.tools
bin
# Build output. `dist` matches at every level, which is what keeps apps/*/dist and packages/*/dist
# out of the context - they are built inside the image. It also keeps presentation/webui/dist out,
# and that is deliberate: the placeholder must not reach the build stage, so that a failed
# frontend build cannot quietly ship a binary that says no interface was built into it.
dist
docs
test/golden-archives
*.md
!locales/**
